* ADI LTC7001 native LTspice model; approximate linear MOS gate load.
* Pin order VCC VCCUV GND INP OVLO TGDN TGUP TS BST.
* This is a component test, not the actual nonlinear MOS / load / fault path.
.include LTC7001.sub
Vcc vcc 0 PWL(0 0 1u 12 1.02 12)
Vin inp 0 PWL(0 0 0.999999 0 1.000000 3.3 1.005999 3.3 1.006000 0 1.02 0)
Xiso vcc 0 0 inp 0 gate tgup 0 bst LTC7001
Rup tgup gate 10k
Rgs gate 0 1Meg
Cgs gate 0 32.1n
Cbst bst 0 1u
.tran 0 1.02 0 50u
.meas tran bst_pre FIND V(bst) AT=0.999
.meas tran gate_pre FIND V(gate) AT=0.999
.meas tran gate_enabled FIND V(gate) AT=1.004
.meas tran bst_enabled FIND V(bst) AT=1.004
.meas tran gate_after_off FIND V(gate) AT=1.007
.end
